          "summary": "Replace one-sided 24-month no-hire with a mutual 12-month non-solicit limited to personnel involved in the Services, with general-advertising and unsolicited-approach carve-outs.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] We cannot accept a no-hire covering every Vendor employee for 24 months \"regardless of how the employee applies\", and it contradicts § 12.3, in which Vendor acknowledges we have given no no-hire commitment. We have made the restriction mutual, limited it to personnel directly involved in the Services for 12 months, and added the customary general-advertising and unsolicited-approach carve-outs; deleting § 12.4 entirely also works for us.",
