              "oldText": "12.4 Customer shall not solicit, hire, or employ any Vendor employee during the term or for twenty-four months afterward, regardless of how the employee applies.",
              "newText": "12.4 Neither party shall directly solicit for employment any personnel of the other party who are directly involved in the Services for twelve months after the end of that individual's involvement in the Services. This Section does not restrict either party from hiring any person who responds to a general advertisement or other general recruitment activity not targeted at the other party's personnel, or who approaches that party on an unsolicited basis, and neither party is subject to any no-hire obligation."
